{"code":"032960","name":"동일기연","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"전자장비와기기","sector_desc":"전자 부품·계측기·기판 등. 스마트폰·자동차·서버 등 전방 산업의 생산 사이클을 따릅니다.","desc":"동사는 1986년 전자제품, 부품 제조·판매·수출입 및 부동산 임대업, 의료기기 제조업 등을 목적으로 설립되었으며, 1997년 코스닥시장에 상장됨. 전자부품 사업부문은 EMI필터, 음이온클러스터 등을, 산업용 사업부문은 제전기, 스마트카메라, 산업용 집진기 및 치과용 의료기기를 생산함. 세라믹소재 기술로 다양한 제품을 개발하며 단일제품 중심에서 벗어나 사업을 다각화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2740.0,"open":2690.0,"high":2890.0,"low":2555.0,"volume":10835,"amount":29687900.0,"ret_1d":-0.1821,"gap":-2.0036,"range_pct":12.2263,"ret_5":4.7801,"ret_20":29.2453,"ret_60":40.0818,"ret_120":-11.7268,"ret_250":18.9236,"ma20":2567.25,"ma60":2222.5167,"ma120":2297.5,"ma200":2645.07,"close_vs_ma200":3.5889,"close_vs_ma60":23.2837,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":357.9193,"r2_60":0.6985,"slope_120":-18.3554,"r2_120":0.0513,"slope_250":-31.2629,"r2_250":0.3748,"high52":3810.0,"low52":1740.0,"pos_52w":48.3092,"dd_52w":-28.084,"mdd_1y":-46.1561,"atr14_pct":12.9953,"vol_ann_60":65.9273,"vol_avg20":76464.35,"vol_ratio20":0.1417,"vr5":6.0371,"vr20":3.1225,"amount_avg5":388680817.0,"amount_avg20":212153339.75,"amount_avg60":83864960.85,"obv_chg20":33.3091,"turnover_20":8.6926,"pv_eff_20":3.3644,"rsi14":58.0534,"frgn_net_5":-13399.0,"inst_net_5":-2046.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0762,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0116,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0878,"frgn_net_20":-15698.0,"inst_net_20":9616.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0892,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0547,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0346,"frgn_net_60":-12625.0,"inst_net_60":34733.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0718,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1974,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1257,"frgn_net_120":-23061.0,"inst_net_120":23861.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1311,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1356,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0045,"foreign_ratio":0.51,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.02,"smart_buy_streak":3,"op_income_q":-1.0,"op_margin_q":-1.5625,"op_qoq":-116.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":66.6667,"rev_yoy":30.6122,"op_trend_4q":-13.3333,"fin_period":"202606","roe":15.42,"debt_ratio":6.65,"per":4.99,"pbr":